' DateLiterals: the forms a date literal may take and the value each one denotes (MS-VBAL 3.3.3).

' Date literal with month day year
? #1/2/2020#

' Date literal with time
? #1/2/2020 3:04:05 PM#

' Date literal with a twenty-four hour time
? #1/2/2020 15:04:05#

' Date literal with time only
? #3:04:05 PM#

' Date literal with a two-digit year
? #1/2/20#

' Date literal with a two-digit year in the past window
? #1/2/30#

' Date literal with a month name
? #Jan 2 2020#

' Date literal with hours and minutes only
? #15:04#

' Date literal in ISO order
? #2020-01-02#

' Date literal with dashes
? #1-2-2020#

' Date literal with midnight
? #1/2/2020 12:00:00 AM#

' Date literal with noon
? #1/2/2020 12:00:00 PM#
